EST, STRENGTH 45. SEEN: RHINO FIRST FOOT, KITE FIRST FOOT, ORCHID FIRST FOOT, ORCHID BOWMEN.","cipher":null},{"seq":579,"t":3300,"type":"courier","id":"c196","house":"tiger","letter":"L235","kind":"report","to":"tiger-camp","path":["south-village","tiger-camp"],"depart":3300,"plain":"HORSE AT TIGER CAMP, STRENGTH 35.","cipher":null},{"seq":580,"t":3300,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1741,"retries":0},{"seq":581,"t":3300,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"My doctrine is to take the west crossing (F1) early. Rhino-inf-1 is already at F1 (4w ago). I must consolidate and act on the captured kite letter: 'MARCH TO NORTH BANK MIDDLE'. I will move forces to intercept or react to this move, while maintaining pressure on F1 and F2."},{"seq":582,"t":3300,"type":"courier","id":"c197","house":"rhino","letter":"L237","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-2","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":3300,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":583,"t":3300,"type":"courier","id":"c198","house":"rhino","letter":"L238","kind":"order","to":"rhino-arch-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west"],"depart":3300,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":584,"t":3300,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1788,"retries":0},{"seq":585,"t":3300,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Rhino and Tiger are pressing F1 (West Ford). My infantry/archery at N-W/F1 needs reinforcement or a strong counter. Kite Cav/Ele at KITE CAMP are positioned to move. I'll reinforce F1 indirectly by moving Ele/Cav towards the action, while sending decoys."},{"seq":586,"t":3300,"type":"courier","id":"c199","house":"kite","letter":"L239","kind":"order","to":"kite-ele-1","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":3600,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":"NHNMDTJSR, ITQLD SK JKQSD ATJG WNRS."},{"seq":587,"t":3300,"type":"courier","id":"c200","house":"kite","letter":"L239","kind":"order","to":"kite-ele-1","path":["kite-camp